    "text": "By Josh Jarnagin ,\n8 hours ago LOUDON COUNTY, Tenn. (WVLT) - A former pastor of a Loudon County church has pleaded guilty to stealing even more money from his church. An investigation by the Tennessee Comptroller’s Office, with the Tennessee Bureau of Investigation, found Nicholas Rains misappropriated at least $332,654.46 from Canvas Fellowship Church in Lenoir City between 2019 and 2023. Read full article",
